**************************************************************************
*
*
*
* 1)To use these models directly by programming in this style: 
*
*     .lib 'lib_path/lib_name' corner_name 
*     
*
*  EX: .lib '/class/ee/lib/hspice/opConditions' TTTT
*        
*             for typical N,PMOS, Temp, Voltage
*      
*  note:
*      corner_name
*       TTTT : typical model, typ operating
*       SSSS : Slow NMOS Slow PMOS model, high temp, low voltage
*
*
******
